      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Judge me, O God, and plead my cause against an ungodly nation: O deliver me from the deceitful and unjust man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.43.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.43.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of my strength: why dost thou cast me off? why go I mourning because of the oppression of the enemy?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.43.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.43.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O send out thy light and thy truth: let them lead me; let them bring me unto thy holy hill, and to thy tabernacles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.43.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.43.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then will I go unto the altar of God, unto God my exceeding joy: yea, upon the harp will I praise thee, O God my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
